{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F9qjU2PEDGvAqj66SZdNaX","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the answer to your question about the Diskless Topics KIP companion proposals and the metadata change:\\\\n\\\\n## Answer\\\\n\\\\nAccording to the discussion in the KIP-1150 (Diskless Topics) mailing list:\\\\n\\\\n**KIP-1181 has been deprecated** because **the metadata change that was originally part of KIP-1181 is now incorporated into KIP-1163**.\\\\n\\\\nSpecifically, from Ivan Yurchenko's response to Jun Rao's feedback:\\\\n\\\\n> \\\\\\\"We have deprecated KIP-1181 as it's now incorporated into KIP-1163.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n**Context:**\\\\n- **KIP-1150**: Diskless Topics (main motivational KIP)\\\\n- **KIP-1163**: Diskless Core (high-level design implementation)  \\\\n- **KIP-1181**: Originally contained metadata change specifications but has been **merged/incorporated** into KIP-1163\\\\n- **KIP-1164**: Updated with latest design (kept independent)\\\\n\\\\nThis consolidation was done to streamline the companion proposal structure, with the metadata change becoming part of the core design in KIP-1163 rather than remaining as a separate independent KIP.\\\\n\\\\n**Source:** `/store/_intake/2026/01/19/mail-4517a25a511ff6f25bb9f2e5-db5cb0e7.md` (lines 40-45)\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"_intake/2026/01/09/mail-b24ca19d2bc0cd7aacd079e8-824a4f8d.md\\\",\\\"_intake/2026/01/12/mail-ea210866a1277c46b831a7bd-e1f172d1.md\\\",\\\"_intake/2026/01/09/mail-ce1de29adef7426ad2d6cfbc-d1991da5.md\\\",\\\"_intake/2026/01/14/mail-9e900521cece967a4fb6c230-b4cf78b3.md\\\",\\\"_intake/2026/01/05/mail-fa4d1eebb9bee6e72f8a5ebc-4a4d9f3a.md\\\",\\\"_intake/2026/01/19/mail-4517a25a511ff6f25bb9f2e5-db5cb0e7.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":38.57,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":487715,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\